region       	cold block  INF INF  281.75650633071152 296.74355453979192  INF INF units box

##region for fixed end

region          A1 block  INF INF  INF 2.99740964181608  INF INF units box
region          A2 block  INF INF  296.74355453979192 INF  INF INF units box
region          gFixed union 2 A1 A2

group            hot region hot
